FlashInfer: native FA2 full CUDA graphs for speculative decoding on sm75.

Opt in with VLLM_FLASHINFER_NATIVE_SPEC_GRAPHS=1 and VLLM_FLASHINFER_SM75=1.
Persistent graph-aware paged-prefill plans are cached per batch/query shape and
causality, supporting target verification and noncausal DFlash query attention.
Metadata is replanned outside replay as sequence lengths and physical pages change.
Only fp16 queries, native fp16/FP8-E4M3 KV, no DCP and no adaptive verification.

Kind: local
